-- ============================================================================
-- 00340 — Demo mode: GPX trace on the Croix d'Aquila hike
--
-- Scott's real GPX (assets/demo/Croix_d_Aquila.gpx): 52 track points running
-- from the Combes trailhead area down to the summit (last point lands on the
-- objective pin). No elevation data in the file, so elevation_gain_m keeps its
-- estimate; distance_km is set to the trace length (~3.0 km, one-way approach).
-- 'route' is a legacy GIS column with no active writer — the app renders from
-- trace_geojson, so only that is set. bypass_lock: trace_geojson + distance_km
-- are whitelist-locked once an activity has participants.
-- ============================================================================
